        <h3>About Lisa</h3><br />
        <p><img src="/assets/aboutme.jpg" alt="A picture of Lisa and Banshee." /></p><br />
        <p>Lisa (she/they) is currently studying for an <a href="https://www.cca.edu/academics/degrees/mfa-comics/">MFA in Comics</a> at the California College of the Arts. She graduates July 2027.
        <p>She lives on Camano Island, WA with her girlfriend <b><a href="https://absolutelyprobablynot.com">Raine</a></b> and their kids and corgis.</p><br />
        She loves to read and draw about sci-fi, queer romance and memoir.  During the day, she works at a video game studio.
        Her dream is to open a Comics Library & Workshop in the Seattle area.</p><br /><br />
        <p>You can reach Lisa at <b><a href="mailto:dahllm@gmail.com">dahllm@gmail.com</a></b> or <b>Dahllm</b> on Discord and <a href="https://instagram.com/dahllm">Instagram</a>!</p><br /><br />
        <h3>Conventions</h3><br />
        <ul style="margin: 0 0 1rem 1.5rem; padding-left: 1.5rem;">
          <li><a target="_blank" href="https://www.smallpressexpo.com/">Small Press Expo (SPX)</a>, Bethesda, MD (September 12-13, 2026) - Upcoming!</li>
          <li><a target="_blank" href="https://portal.cca.edu/events-calendar/comics-city-summer-2025-series/emanata-gallery-show-opening-reception-2025/">CCA Emanata Gallery Show</a>, San Francisco, CA (July 17 - 31, 2026) - Upcoming!</li>
          <li><a target="_blank" href="https://sourcherrycomics.com/">Sour Cherry Comics</a>, San Francisco, CA (July 4, 2026) - Upcoming!</li>
          <li><i><a target="_blank" href="https://prideinpanels.net/">Pride in Panels</a>, San Francisco, CA (February 2026) - Exhibited</i></li>
          <li><i><a target="_blank" href="https://www.vancaf.org/">Vancouver Comics & Arts Festival</a>, Vancouver, Canada (May 2024) - Exhibited</i></li>
        </ul>
        <img src="/assets/convention.jpg" alt="A picture of my convention table at 2026 Pride in Panels.">
        
